Subject: [PATCH] Replace MCP server when owning app changes

The API identifies an MCP server by its owning app and connector. Changing
app_id must create a new server under the selected app.

diff --git a/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go b/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go
--- a/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go
+++ b/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go
@@ -148,5 +148,8 @@ func (r *MCPServerResource) Schema(ctx context.Context, req resource.SchemaRequ
 			},
 			"app_id": schema.StringAttribute{
 				Required:    true,
-				Description: `App identifier that owns this MCP server.`,
+				PlanModifiers: []planmodifier.String{
+					stringplanmodifier.RequiresReplace(),
+				},
+				Description: `App identifier that owns this MCP server. Requires replacement if changed.`,
 			},
